%% §21 machine 7 of 8 — Earnings  (Prisma enum: EarningState)
%% §21: PENDING -> ELIGIBLE -> APPROVED_FOR_PAYOUT -> PAID / HELD / DISPUTED
%% These six states are P7-BE-01's acceptance and match the Phase 1 Payment Policy (G-01) §2.
    direction TB
    [*] --> PENDING : order accepted, work not yet complete
    PENDING --> ELIGIBLE : order COMPLETED
    ELIGIBLE --> APPROVED_FOR_PAYOUT : finance approves
    APPROVED_FOR_PAYOUT --> PAID : payment made outside SponsorX
    ELIGIBLE --> HELD : query raised
    APPROVED_FOR_PAYOUT --> HELD : query raised
    HELD --> ELIGIBLE : query resolved (derived)
    ELIGIBLE --> DISPUTED : athlete disputes the amount
    DISPUTED --> ELIGIBLE : dispute resolved (derived)
    PAID --> [*]

    note right of PAID
      PAID is a bookkeeping mark about something that
      already happened elsewhere — never an instruction
      to move money. SponsorX stores no bank details
      and collects no tax IDs in Phase 1 (§26, G-01).
    end note
